 "best_idea":"Find the overhead roof nearest the player, flood-fill the connected roof tiles within 6 height units to get the lowest connected roof, cap the draw there but never below the player's height plus 16, and fade the roofs above the cap out over a few ticks instead of cutting them.",
 "decision":"adapt",
 "decision_why":"The height window and flood-filled ground height fit a town-building occlusion rule for the world client, but it is client-only draw logic: it must not decide anything the server verifies, and the diagonal scan offset and the unbounded flood fill must not be copied.",
